                                "sense_id": "5a59bc9f-5e7d-38f5-b9c9-2702d847bf2e",
                                "text": "Not all fruits can be intergrafted. There must be a relation between stock and scion. In general plants of the same species but of different varieties may be intergrafted, as any variety of apple, plum or pear, upon another."
